{
    "title": "Shhhh - Live Video chat",
    "description": "Shhhh is not only a social software, but also a wonderful journey for you to explore the world, meet like-minded friends, and share life. We are committed to creating an all-round social platform that integrates video chat, instant messaging, smart matching, creative short videos and automatic translation of multiple languages.\r\n\r\nVideo Chat:\r\nShhhh's video chat function allows you to interact with global users instantly. Whether it is a friend in a foreign country or a new partner you just met, smooth video calls can instantly shorten the distance.\r\n\r\nInstant Messaging:\r\nThe IM chat system supports multiple message forms such as text and pictures, making communication more vivid and interesting. Whether it is daily greetings or late-night talks, Shhhh is your most intimate companion.\r\n\r\nSmart Matching:\r\nBased on advanced algorithm technology, Shhhh can accurately recommend high-quality users around the world for you, making every click full of infinite possibilities.\r\n\r\nCreative Short Video:\r\nShhhh brings together bloggers from all over the world, who use their cameras to record every wonderful moment in life. You can watch these short videos and appreciate the unique charm of all parts of the world.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shhhh is not only a social software, but also a wonderful journey for you to explore the world, meet like-minded friends, and share life. We are committed to creating an all-round social platform that integrates video chat, instant messaging, smart matching, creative short videos and automatic translation of multiple languages.<br><br>Video Chat:<br>Shhhh&#39;s video chat function allows you to interact with global users instantly. Whether it is a friend in a foreign country or a new partner you just met, smooth video calls can instantly shorten the distance.<br><br>Instant Messaging:<br>The IM chat system supports multiple message forms such as text and pictures, making communication more vivid and interesting. Whether it is daily greetings or late-night talks, Shhhh is your most intimate companion.<br><br>Smart Matching:<br>Based on advanced algorithm technology, Shhhh can accurately recommend high-quality users around the world for you, making every click full of infinite possibilities.<br><br>Creative Short Video:<br>Shhhh brings together bloggers from all over the world, who use their cameras to record every wonderful moment in life. You can watch these short videos and appreciate the unique charm of all parts of the world.",
